{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0FuaW1hdGlvbi8yMDIxLS0yMDI0L1NlYWwlMjBUZWFtJTIwJTI4MjAyMSUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"Seal Team","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/yPZ3I27oeSm4zVesgMxXlhW8GDe.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vd73vTYjFpXoPmw5612ZHjEBI5J.jpg","description":"After his best friend is killed in a shark attack, Quinn, a lovable yet tenacious seal assembles a SEAL TEAM to fight back against a gang of sharks overtaking the neighborhood. But this merry band of international seals are not at all trained for such a mission. They seek the help of a much more skillful combatant, Claggart, but even his tricks and flips can’t whip these guys into shape. However, with a little bit of ingenuity, intelligence and a lot of heart, our SEAL TEAM may actually be able to bring peace back to their undersea community.","releaseInfo":"2021","genres":["Animation","Family","Animation"],"imdbRating":"6.9","runtime":"98 min","cast":["Jessie T. Usher","J.K. Simmons","Matthew Rhys","Kristen Schaal","Patrick Warburton","Sharlto Copley","Camille Mana","John Kani"],"director":["Greig Cameron"],"released":"2021-10-28T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Jaws will drop!","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Jessie T. Usher","character":"Quinn (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/iiu9dkYEkHJPMf7TzbrhhgwRvlt.jpg"},{"name":"J.K. Simmons","character":"Claggart (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ScmKoJ9eiSUOthAt1PDNLi8Fkw.jpg"},{"name":"Matthew Rhys","character":"Grimes (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8uktKexgPn0tsW3dsXVNqkqiNh7.jpg"},{"name":"Kristen Schaal","character":"Beth (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/s3LSHVTx8gxHP2twYsXEGa8JbLl.jpg"},{"name":"Patrick Warburton","character":"Geraldo (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/nDoOii5HaGwPxYa28xFC2sDkF8y.jpg"},{"name":"Sharlto Copley","character":"Switch (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/em89OJJvBRX7kNJJPASm